OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G1300FElaine Paige on Sunday
OL,5,     GThe last of a trio of themed
OL,6,     Gshows that are interlinked... and
OL,7,     Gthe theme is Kiss, Marry, Avoid!
OL,8,     GToday it's all about the
OL,9,     Gcharacters who it might be an
OL,10,     Gidea to give the slip!
OL,11,G1500FSounds of the 70s with Bob Harris
OL,12,     GBob has got all your 70s music
OL,13,     Gvibes covered, he's marking Dolly
OL,14,     GParton's 80th birthday, and Janis
OL,15,     GIan is the focus for the 'Best of
OL,16,     GThe Test'.
OL,17,G1700FPick of the Pops
OL,18,     GMark Goodier counts down the
OL,19,     Gchart from this day in 1969.
OL,20,G1800FPick of the Pops
OL,21,     GMark Goodier counts down the
OL,22,     Gchart from this day in 1977.
